  (. or source)\n\
\n\
Traps:                 %d\n\
Exits:                 %d\n", \
fn_count+0, fn_max+0, (max_fn_name != "" ? max_fn_name : "unknown"), avg_fn, \
fn_50+0, fn_100+0, fn_1000+0, max_fn_nesting+0, max_brace_depth+0, total+0, \
nonblank+0, sloc+0, nonblank_pct_disp, nonblank+0, total+0, nonblank_x, \
sloc_pct_disp, sloc+0, total+0, sloc_x, blank_pct_disp, blank+0, total+0, \
blank_x, blank+0, char_total+0, char_nonws+0, avg_nonws_per_sloc, \
